  "ja119:0.4": "9 akālarāvijātakaṃ ",
  "ja119:1.1": "amātāpitusaṃvaḍḍho ",
  "ja119:1.2": "anācariyakule vasaṃ ",
  "ja119:1.3": "nāyaṃ kālamakālaṃ vā ",
  "ja119:1.4": "abhijānāti kukkuṭoti. ",
  "ja119:2.1": "akālarāvijātakaṃ navamaṃ. "
